WeightedECDSAGasGriefingTest
├── when signature count exceeds MAX_SIGNATURES
│   └── it should return SIG_VALIDATION_FAILED_UINT
├── when signature count equals MAX_SIGNATURES with valid guardians
│   └── it should return SIG_VALIDATION_SUCCESS_UINT
├── when signature count equals MAX_SIGNATURES with non-guardians
│   └── it should return SIG_VALIDATION_FAILED_UINT when threshold not met
├── when signature count is less than MAX_SIGNATURES
│   └── it should validate normally and succeed when threshold met
├── when signature count is zero
│   └── it should return SIG_VALIDATION_FAILED_UINT
├── when signature length is not a multiple of 65
│   └── it should return SIG_VALIDATION_FAILED_UINT
├── when ERC1271 signature count exceeds MAX_SIGNATURES
│   └── it should return ERC1271_INVALID
├── when signer has zero weight in guardian storage
│   └── it should not contribute to threshold accumulation
└── when multiple zero-weight signers are provided
    └── it should fail to meet threshold
